<title>POLAND: SOCCER-POLAND 2 MOLODVA 1  LATEST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-POLAND 2 MOLODVA 1  LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>KATOWICE, Poland 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland led Moldova 2-1</p>
<p>in their World Cup European Group two qualifying match on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Poland: Henryk Baluszynski 4, Krzysztof Warzycha 76 penalty</p>
<p>Moldova: Serghei Clescenco 78 penalty</p>
</text>
